  // than 120 raw beams), the goal in the robot frame (dx/10, dy/10 clipped to ±1, distance/10, cos and sin of its
  // bearing), the odometry's v/1.5 and ω/2: 139 numbers, the same order tools/collect-policy.mjs writes
